0/extras/2acea1e3555ca04b0bd46801d9beb090.mp4?t=1746341655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your playstyle with over 200 types of equipment, from powerful weapons to rare artifacts that enhance your cooking and combat abilities. Experiment with unique combinations to discover the setup that best suits your survival needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/6aae47d62a551b36a9638d68da734517.poster.avif?t=1746341655\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/6aae47d62a551b36a9638d68da734517.webm?t=1746341655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/6aae47d62a551b36a9638d68da734517.mp4?t=1746341655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this is brought to life with breathtaking, high-quality graphics that immerse you in the mysterious and dangerous world of the dungeon. Every monster, meal, and piece of gear is rendered with stunning detail, making your journey as visually captivating as it is challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you conquer the abyss, or will the dungeon claim you as its next victim? Gather your courage, sharpen your skills, and prepare for an adventure that blends survival, strategy, and culinary creativity like never before. The dungeon awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/07e1ca0d0875668ab0ceda0e22c047e9.avif?t=1746341655\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras_big/07e1ca0d0875668ab0ceda0e22c047e9.avif?t=174634